Bundled dataset "Demo Race 07" (lookups/splap_demo_*.csv.gz, appserver/static/demo/*):
  Synthetic, original data generated by Federal AI LLC with tools/gen_demo.py (deterministic seed).
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
  It contains no official motorsport timing, telemetry, results, names, marks or circuit geometry.

Bundled real session (lookups/splap_monza_2025_*.csv.gz, appserver/static/sessions/monza_2025/*):
  2025 Italian Grand Prix, Race, Monza. Timing, positions, laps, stints, pit stops, intervals, race control,
  weather, team radio metadata, location and car telemetry from OpenF1 (https://openf1.org), an unofficial,
  community-run API, used under its non-commercial terms. Circuit geometry is derived by SPLap from the
  session's own position samples; track width is a modeled constant. Team colours are the provider-supplied
  team colour plus curated approximations. No logos, sponsor art, driver likenesses, official typography or
  protected circuit artwork are included.

Brand assets (static/appIcon*.png, appserver/static/images/*): original SPLap marks, Federal AI LLC.

Third-party components: none are bundled. The UI uses only the jQuery, Underscore and SplunkJS modules
that Splunk Web already provides at runtime. Fonts are system fonts.

